    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster and Snakes are Action and adventure Game. Man walk and collects coins and timants and sword , Arrows.  You can destroy sworts and arrows Snakes and monsters.  The game has good sides are no brutality or bloodshed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game are Adventure and Action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are ghosts and snakes and other monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can destroy enemies  sword and arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game have 10 Levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump levels and destroy Enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay are easy and fits beginers / Starters and older players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is well suited for children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game language is English. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game functions: move foward and back , jump , use 2 weapons sword and arrow throws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the jungle, a brave man embarked on an adventure filled with monsters and snakes. Armed with a sword and a quiver full of arrows, he set out to explore the mysterious lands in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he walked through the dense foliage, the man came across glittering coins and shimmering diamonds scattered along his path. With a keen eye, he collected them all, knowing that they would come in handy on his quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, a menacing figure emerged from the shadows\u2014a giant snake, its forked tongue flickering in the air. Without hesitation, the man unsheathed his sword and prepared to face the slithering creature. With a swift motion, he struck, defeating the snake with one decisive blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look youtube Monster and Snakes 1,1 Update version video.\u00a0\u00a0Youtube link on the Left side of the page</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play keyboard  Arrows and  Keys A , S , D , F  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game works Win 10  / 64 Mb. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory stick size:  32 GT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Game</p>",
